paddleocr 3.3.3  --  local/offline scanned-page OCR fallback
(app/ocr/engine.py, M8-CONTRACTS.md §0.4)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
License: Apache License 2.0 (verified via PyPI metadata for
paddleocr==3.3.3: `info.license` = "Apache License 2.0"). No conflict with
Apache-2.0 distribution.

Usage in this project: optional dependency, not installed by default (see
requirements-ocr.txt's own header comment and README.md's `OCR_ENGINE`
section). Only exercised when an operator explicitly sets
`OCR_ENGINE=paddle` and installs `requirements-ocr.txt`; runs entirely
locally/offline against PDF page renders produced by this service, with no
outbound network calls made by this service itself during OCR inference
(model weight files may be downloaded once on first use by the paddleocr/
paddlepaddle libraries themselves from their configured model source --
see README.md for the `PADDLE_PDX_MODEL_SOURCE` operational note for
network-restricted environments).

